{
  "title": "Sara's bakery: how a good prompt works",
  "lang": "en",
  "engine": "chatterbox",
  "voice": "default",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "This is Sara. She has a small bakery.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "photo",
          "params": {
            "src": "examples/assets/prompt_story/sara_bakery.png",
            "tag": "Meet Sara"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Every day, she must post on Instagram to get new customers. But she is busy, and she is tired.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "photo",
          "params": {
            "src": "examples/assets/prompt_story/sara_tired.png",
            "tag": "No time"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "One night, she asks AI: write a post about my bread.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "chat",
          "params": {
            "prompt": "Write a post about my bread."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The answer is boring. It sounds like a robot. Only three people like it.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "chat",
          "params": {
            "prompt": "Write a post about my bread.",
            "reply": "Our bread is good. Come and buy bread at our shop today."
          },
          "box": {
            "x": 160,
            "y": 1500,
            "w": 1840,
            "h": 1150,
            "zoom": 1.35
          }
        },
        {
          "template": "stat",
          "params": {
            "value": "3",
            "label": "likes. Ouch."
          },
          "offset": 1.6,
          "box": {
            "x": 160,
            "y": 650,
            "w": 1840,
            "h": 800,
            "zoom": 1.35
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Then her friend shows her a secret. A good prompt has four simple parts.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "photo",
          "params": {
            "src": "examples/assets/prompt_story/sara_friend.png",
            "tag": "The secret"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Who the AI is. What to do. The details. And how the answer should look.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "list",
          "params": {
            "title": "4 parts of a good prompt",
            "items": [
              "1. Who the AI is",
              "2. What to do",
              "3. The details",
              "4. How it looks"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So Sara opens the AI again and writes a new prompt, step by step.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "chat",
          "params": {
            "prompt": "You are a friendly baker. Write 3 short posts. My bread is fresh at 7 am. Use a warm, happy voice."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now the posts are warm and fun. They sound just like her.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "photo",
          "params": {
            "src": "examples/assets/prompt_story/phone_post.png",
            "tag": "Warm & fun"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Before, she wrote one short line. Now, she gives clear details.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "compare",
          "params": {
            "before": "Write a post about my bread.",
            "after": "You are a friendly baker. Write 3 warm posts. Fresh bread at 7 am."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After one month, her likes grow every single week, and many new people come to the shop.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "bars",
          "params": {
            "title": "Likes per week",
            "bars": [
              {
                "label": "Week 1",
                "value": 12
              },
              {
                "label": "Week 2",
                "value": 45
              },
              {
                "label": "Week 3",
                "value": 110
              },
              {
                "label": "Week 4",
                "value": 240
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Remember: AI is not magic. A clear prompt gives a clear answer.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "photo",
          "params": {
            "src": "examples/assets/prompt_story/sara_happy.png"
          }
        },
        {
          "template": "title",
          "params": {
            "text": "Clear prompt = clear answer",
            "kicker": "THE LESSON"
          },
          "offset": 0.4,
          "box": {
            "x": 160,
            "y": 1500,
            "w": 1840,
            "h": 1150,
            "zoom": 1.35
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Follow for more easy AI tips.",
      "graphics": [
        {
          "template": "nametag",
          "params": {
            "name": "Follow for more",
            "subtitle": "Easy AI tips every week"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}